openCook Web
============

This project is a new web application inspired by and based on ideas, data-model
concepts and algorithms from openCook:

  https://github.com/oliexdev/openCook
  Copyright (C) 2026 olie.xdev <olie.xdeveloper@googlemail.com>
  Licensed under the GNU General Public License v3 (see LICENSE).

The Mela importer in this repository is newly written for openCook Web and follows
the publicly documented Mela file format:

  https://mela.recipes/fileformat/index.html

